This repository ("Openweight Canary" or the "Software") is original work of Andrea
Taini ("Licensor"): a black-box test that checks whether an open-weight model or an
agent harness sends data out of the computer.

1. THIRD-PARTY CODE: Any third-party library or file that the Software uses or
   includes remains governed by its own license. Nothing in this License alters,
   revokes, or restricts your rights under those licenses with respect to that
   third-party code. The prompts and tool definitions of open-source agent
   harnesses that the Software reproduces to build its harness profiles stay under
   the licenses of those harnesses.

2. THE SOFTWARE: All files in this repository are the exclusive intellectual
   property and copyright of the Licensor and are licensed exclusively under the
   terms of this License. They are NOT licensed under the MIT License.

